+# QET Platform — Complete Redesign Specification & Implementation Plan
+
+## What We Are Locking In (Decision Summary)
+
+```
+Navigation:     Single top bar only. No left sidebar. Ever.
+Layout flow:    Agent status → Timeline → Upload → Results (top to bottom)
+Provider:       Compact OpenAI / Gemini switch, top right
+Heading:        QET Agent
+Subheading:     Autonomous Quality Execution Platform
+Color system:   Slate + Teal + Indigo (defined below)
+Upload:         Large → auto-shrinks to compact summary after success
+File list:      Count only by default. Expand to see files.
+ZIP sub-steps:  Summary row by default. Expand for decision table.
+Autoscroll:     Triggers after each completed step. No loop jitter.
+JSON fix:       Accept fenced JSON + safe repair. Fail-fast on truly bad output.
+```
