+Gate:  Test with fenced JSON → parses correctly.
+       Test with truncated JSON → fails with truncated:true diagnostic.
+       Test with garbage → fails with parse_failed diagnostic.
+
+PHASE 7: Understanding UI Polish
+─────────────────────────────────
+Files: UnderstandingPanel.tsx, FailDiagnosticsCard.tsx
+Goal:  Success shows clean summary + provenance row.
